{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日初めてばいしくるのCM見たよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみの声だった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばきのうのみなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなみに呼ばれて\n振り返ったら\n500mlペットボトルを4、5本持ってて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見て〜♪♪\nなんか\nかばんからお茶いっぱいでてきた〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かばんがなんかごつごつしてるって思ったら\nいっぱいお茶入ってたらしい(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3324760/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写メ\nみなみより後ろのぶれてる\nかずryがきになるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nFIFA　U-20女子ワールドカップジャパン2012のＰＲイベントに\nださせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PKを\nれいか、まいまい、生駒ちゃんの3人が\nやったんだけど\nみんなシュートきめてたよ！\nかっこいいね！(*゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それより\nヤングなでしこさん\nほんとかっこいいよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/15/3324760/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田もサッカーできるようになりたいな｀・ω・´\n教えてもらいたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナンすき？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n好き！\nカレーにはライスもいいけど\nナンだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てるとこ見たことないメンバーいる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nみんな見たことあるかも(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左足の膝上くらいにアザなかった？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nあれ蚊に刺されたあと←\nもう治ったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーんと\nうーんと\nどうしよ(゜-゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度書こおっと←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}